type: software
title: "GPU over IP: Vulkan on a remote GPU, over plain TCP"
abstract: "Patches to Mesa's Venus Vulkan driver and to virglrenderer that carry the Venus protocol over an ordinary TCP connection instead of shared memory, with a dated research log of the measurements, bugs and dead ends."
